===================

v5.0-r2
* [FIX] Students can't view a flashcard question directly after creating it
* [FIX] Students can't view pictures included in flashcard questions
* [FIX] Add single questions from question bank is not possible
* [FIX] Missing default category for flashcards module after upgrade on Moodle 5.0 (due to the new question bank)
* [FIX] Deleting a user's data of flashcards via data request for privacy API is not successful
* [FIX] Format of date in the overview table in the flashcards collection
* [FIX] Behaviour of the options area in the flashcards collection
* [FIX] Update German langstring for propper use on the activities page
* [FEATURE] Set the default category in the new flashcards question bank
* [FEATURE] Update the CSS of the window to add questions from the question bank
* [FEATURE] Remove not needed filter "Flashcards added by students"

v5.0-r1
