* Moodle 5.0 compatible version
* [FIX] Filter in the flashcards collection is reset when switching to another page of the collection
* [FIX] No information to flashcards is included in the exported data of a data request for privacy API
* [FIX] Pagination in the flashcards collection not available for students
* [FEATURE] Update to the question renderer